Package: floodplains
Title: Floodplain Delineation and Land Cover Change Across BC Watershed Groups
Version: 0.1.4
Date: 2026-10-02
Description: Config-driven driver and provenance layer over the link, flooded and
    drift packages: per-area network extraction, VCA floodplain delineation, and
    STAC land cover classification with change detection and disturbance
    attribution. The version identifies a state of this driver; package
    dependencies are installed by scripts/packages.R.
License: MIT
